§ `Cross-references`

GIVEN c IS A `A cross-reference`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the citation points at what it says` MEANS c's `the citing words say it points at` EQUALS c's `the target is`

GIVEN c IS A `A cross-reference`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the target has everything the citing words name` MEANS c's `how many of them the target has` AT LEAST c's `how many things the citing words name`

