§ `The indexation clause`

GIVEN k IS A `An indexation clause`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the clause names an organ that publishes the updated amounts` MEANS
    CONSIDER k's `the organ the clause names to publish the updated amounts`
        WHEN JUST organ THEN TRUE
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

GIVEN k IS A `An indexation clause`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the first update day is after the day the instrument was published` MEANS
    (k's `the day the instrument that added the clause was published`) LESS THAN (k's `the first update day after that`)

-- DEFECT I3. The clause updates the listed amounts "on 1 January of each year" by the rise of an index, and names no organ that publishes the result (the quoted sentence above names none; limb (b) is the printed page).
-- It says nothing about which amounts, the amounts as enacted or the updated ones, a claim for damage before the first update day uses.
-- The instrument that added the clause is dated 4 May 2026 (the footer line of the deposited crop of printed page 561). The first 1 January after that day is 1 January 2027, so no amount can have been updated before then (an INFERENCE from "1 January of each year" and the date; ASSUMED, not ruled: that no update fell due on 1 January 2026, before the clause existed).
-- Whether a later instrument touched the sentence was not looked for; the consolidation prints the same sentence (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY for that).
`clause: the annual update in s 38נד` MEANS
    `An indexation clause` WITH
        `the clause is in` IS "s 38נד, the sentence quoted on the src:967 line and the ext:[SH 3525 p.561 ...] line"
        `the day of each year it updates on` IS "1 January"
        `the day the instrument that added the clause was published` IS Date 4 5 2026
        `the first update day after that` IS Date 1 1 2027
        `the organ the clause names to publish the updated amounts` IS NOTHING
        `the clause says which amounts a claim for damage before the first update day uses` IS FALSE
        `the clause was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
        `the day of publication was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

§ `The power to change a rate`

GIVEN p IS A `A power to change a rate`
      i IS A `An instrument made under a power`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the instrument is the kind of instrument the power names` MEANS
    p's `the kind of instrument the power names` EQUALS i's `the kind of the instrument`

GIVEN p IS A `A power to change a rate`
      i IS A `An instrument made under a power`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the approving bodies agree` MEANS
    p's `the body whose approval the power requires` EQUALS i's `the body whose approval the instrument recites`

GIVEN i IS A `An instrument made under a power`
      r IS A `A rate set for a tax year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the instrument was signed before the tax year began` MEANS
    (i's `the day the instrument was signed`) LESS THAN (r's `the first day of that tax year`)

GIVEN p IS A `A power to change a rate`
      r IS A `A rate set for a tax year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the instrument sets one figure for each base the statutory rate is set on` MEANS
    r's `how many figures the instrument sets for that tax year` EQUALS p's `how many bases the statutory rate is set on`

-- THE POWER. Section 2א(ב) lets the Minister of Finance, with the approval of the Finance Committee of the Knesset, change the rate fixed in subsection (א), and says that a notice of it is to be published in Reshumot.
-- Subsection (א) fixes two shares: 25 percent of the property tax and 15 percent of purchase tax (the excerpt deposits line 130 only as far as those two shares). All of this is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY.
-- The consolidation's own note under the section says that regulations were published (line 133).
-- src:129 | סעיף 2א – קרן פיצויים [תיקון: תשכ״ז, תשל״ו, תשמ״א, תשמ״ט, תשנ״ט, תשפ״ו־2]
-- src:130 | (א) 25% ממס הרכוש וכן 15% ממס רכישה […]
-- src:131 | (ב) שר האוצר, באישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת, רשאי לשנות את השיעור הקבוע בסעיף קטן (א); הודעה על כך תפורסם ברשומות.
-- src:133 | [note: פורסמו תקנות מס רכוש וקרן פיצויים (שיעור ההפרשה לקרן פיצויים), התשנ״א–1991.]
`power: s 2א(ב), to change the rate in s 2א(א)` MEANS
    `A power to change a rate` WITH
        `the power is in` IS "s 2א(ב) of the Law, the words quoted on the src:131 line"
        `the kind of instrument the power names` IS `a notice published in Reshumot`
        `the body whose approval the power requires` IS "the Finance Committee of the Knesset"
        `how many bases the statutory rate is set on` IS 2
        `the power was read from` IS `the consolidation only`

-- THE INSTRUMENT. The regulations on the deposited page extract of Kovetz HaTakanot 11193 (printed page 1886, issue of 7 March 2024), read from the page image: made under ss 2א and 65 of the Law with the approval of the Finance Committee,
-- they say that for the tax years 2024 and 2025 regulation 1 of the 1991 Fund-rate regulations is read as if, in 2024, "25%" were replaced by "80%", and, in 2025, "25%" by "100%". They are regulations, signed 26 Adar I 5784 = 6 March 2024.
-- ext:[KT 11193 p.1886, read from the deposited page] | תקנות מס רכוש וקרן פיצויים (שיעור ההפרשה לקרן פיצויים) (הוראת שעה), התשפ"ד–2024
-- ext:[KT 11193 p.1886, read from the deposited page] | בתוקף סמכותי לפי סעיפים 2א ו–65 לחוק מס רכוש וקרן פיצויים, התשכ"א–1961, ובאישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת, אני מתקין תקנות אלה:
-- ext:[KT 11193 p.1886, read from the deposited page] | בשנות המס 2024 ו–2025 יקראו את תקנה 1 לתקנות מס רכוש וקרן פיצויים (שיעור ההפרשה לקרן פיצויים), התשנ"א–1991, כאילו –
-- ext:[KT 11193 p.1886, read from the deposited page] | (1) בשנת המס 2024, במקום "25%" בא "80%";
-- ext:[KT 11193 p.1886, read from the deposited page] | (2) בשנת המס 2025, במקום "25%" בא "100%".
-- The regulations set ONE figure for each tax year; the base of the 25% they replace is the single figure of regulation 1 (read from the replacement words; the 1991 regulations themselves were not read).
`instrument: the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886` MEANS
    `An instrument made under a power` WITH
        `the instrument is` IS "the regulations whose page is Kovetz HaTakanot 11193, printed page 1886"
        `the kind of the instrument` IS `regulations published in Kovetz HaTakanot`
        `the body whose approval the instrument recites` IS "the Finance Committee of the Knesset"
        `the day the instrument was signed` IS Date 6 3 2024
        `the instrument was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

-- THE TAX YEAR. "Tax year" is defined in the consolidation as the twelve months beginning on 1 January of each year (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY):
-- src:114 | ”שנת מס“ – שנים עשר החדשים המתחילים ב־1 בינואר של כל שנה.
-- The regulations were signed on 6 March 2024, the 66th day of the tax year 2024 (65 days after 1 January 2024), and so after the year they set a rate for had begun. For the tax year 2025, which began on 1 January 2025, they were signed before the year began (the control).
`rate: tax year 2024, set by the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886` MEANS
    `A rate set for a tax year` WITH
        `the tax year` IS 2024
        `the percentage set` IS 80
        `how many figures the instrument sets for that tax year` IS 1
        `the first day of that tax year` IS Date 1 1 2024
        `the first day was read from` IS `the consolidation only`

`rate: tax year 2025, set by the regulations on KT 11193 p. 1886` MEANS
    `A rate set for a tax year` WITH
        `the tax year` IS 2025
        `the percentage set` IS 100
        `how many figures the instrument sets for that tax year` IS 1
        `the first day of that tax year` IS Date 1 1 2025
        `the first day was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
